## Middleware Scope

### App-Level (Global)

```go
// Applies to ALL routes
app.Use(logger.New())
app.Use(cors.New())
```

### Route-Level (Specific)

```go
// Single route
app.Get("/admin", adminAuthMiddleware, adminHandler)

// Multiple middleware on one route
app.Post("/payment",
    authMiddleware,
    validatePayment,
    rateLimiter,
    processPayment,
)
```

### Group-Level

```go
// Applies to all routes in group
api := app.Group("/api", authMiddleware)
api.Get("/users", listUsers)      // Has authMiddleware
api.Get("/posts", listPosts)      // Has authMiddleware

// Nested groups
v1 := api.Group("/v1", versionMiddleware)
v1.Get("/users", listUsersV1)     // Has both auth and version middleware
```

